  "summary": "Nmap versions up to and including 7.99 contains a denial of service vulnerability that allows remote attackers to crash…",
  "details": "Nmap versions up to and including 7.99 contains a denial of service vulnerability that allows remote attackers to crash the application by sending a crafted packet containing a zero-length TCP option. The malformed packet forces the Packet:parse_options() function in nselib/packet.lua to allocate objects in an infinite loop, causing an out-of-memory condition that results in application crash.",
